; The arity and signature comparison of every intrinsic (arity.ml, oracle.ml).
; It is a program rather than a test because its expected side is the native
; compiler and its corpus is a directory this repository does not carry.
; `dune runtest` runs the library half and both controls through run.sh, with
; no compiler and no corpus; `make intrinsic-arity` runs the compiler half too.

(executable
 (name arity)
 (modules arity oracle)
 (libraries jide_engine jide_jasmin jide_lang unix))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (action
  (run sh %{dep:run.sh} %{exe:arity.exe})))
